### Verify service-to-service communication
GET http://localhost:8083/api/analytics/TCS/market-data?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### Calculate TCS EMA(1)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/analytics/TCS/ema?period=1&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### Calculate TCS RSI(14)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/analytics/TCS/rsi?period=14&from=2026-09-21&to=2026-10-09

### RSI - Insufficient historical data
GET http://localhost:8083/api/analytics/TCS/rsi?period=14&from=2026-10-12&to=2026-10-12
